text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le04ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "Suppose you saw a UFO. What would you do? Would you think someone was crazy, if they told you they had? Would you be interested in documenting cases like these if it were your job? If you were to call me at the UFO sighting center, I'd ask you a lot of questions. If I believed your story, I would document it and pass it along to authorities. If you heard the same story from three different people who didn't know each other, your interest would be piqued like mine was.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le04ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "30000", "text": "On February 2nd, we received a telephone call from a mother who remembered looking at the clock when her children burst into the house. They began to describe a \"flying saucer\" that streaked out of the sky and hovered just above them. They were shocked but remembered to stay together as the moved away.  The children went on to describe how the object bathed them in white light, then streaked off. The second caller was a college boy visiting home about thirty miles away.  After going outside for a walk, he found himself sitting in the grass in his underwear, his clothes neatly stacked beside him in a field.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le04ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "68000", "text": "He forgot to look at the time until he was back inside. He was shocked to see that he had been gone several hours. He went on talking for a while after he called, clearly distressed and feeling slightly disoriented. We advised coming to see us. The third call was from a retired Air Force captain. He saw a large strange white light descend to ground level.  He regretted not having a camera to capture the event. If you had found that none of these people had ever met would you have been surprised? I was not.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le04ob07re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le04ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le04ob07re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}], "id": 0}]}